      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-11T19:15:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><br>I was going to ask a couple of weeks ago if you guys had anything special for Tabletop Day, but didn't see anything posted and&nbsp;left.&nbsp; My group has a pretty full day mostly planned, and I plan to take SotM with me since I find it a fantastic gateway game.&nbsp; Then today you sent out a newletter stating we should let you (GtG) know if we want to be citizens specifically under the tabletop day heading.&nbsp; Admittedly I have not dug everywhere but I do not see anything about that program anywhere.&nbsp; Is there more to know about?&nbsp; No link in the email either which I thought was odd.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
